25. Initial Ingress Error
====================================================================

Original ingress used:

ingressClassName: traefik

Error:

IngressClass.networking.k8s.io "traefik" not found

Reason:
Traefik existed only in K3s. EKS uses AWS Load Balancer Controller.

Fix:

ingressClassName: alb

====================================================================
26. TargetGroup Port Error
====================================================================

Second error:

TargetGroup port is empty.
When using Instance targets, your service must be of type NodePort or LoadBalancer.

Reason:
AWS ALB default target type was instance, but service was ClusterIP.

Fix:
Added annotation:

alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type: ip

This allows ALB to directly target pod IPs.

====================================================================
27. Final ALB Ingress YAML
====================================================================

apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
name: two-tier-app-ingress
annotations:
alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/scheme: internet-facing
alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type: ip
spec:
ingressClassName: alb
rules:
- http:
paths:
- path: /
pathType: Prefix
backend:
service:
name: two-tier-app-svc
port:
number: 80

Apply:

kubectl apply -f two-tier-app-ingress.yml

