4. Fix ECR Permission Issue

IAM Role:

EKS-Admin-Role

Policy Attached:

AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryFullAccess

Purpose:

Provides permissions for:

- Create repository
- Describe repositories
- Authenticate to ECR
- Push images
- Pull images
- Manage image metadata

After attaching the policy, ECR commands started working successfully.

